		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Re: RD-5R - cannot connect to hotspot - Timeout]]></title>

		
		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=5106&amp;p=37018#p37018"><![CDATA[
Thanks for the suggestions!<br>Finally it was an issue with the calibration data.<br>After firmware installation and backup of calibration data the reference oscillator tuning was originally -55.<br>Changing it to -41 I was able to activate the mmdvm hotspot, with fine tuning to -37 I'm happy with very low BER.<br>Usually I try to avoid mess with calibration data, in this case with the second hand device I'm good.<br>vy 73 de Joachim<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=8558">DL6EK</a> — Tue May 06, 2025 4:55 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
